# BuildKit uses this instead of the root .dockerignore for runner/Dockerfile.
# Root context, narrow allowlist: the workspace lockfile, every workspace
# manifest (Bun validates the lockfile against all of them), and runner source.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!web/package.json
!video/package.json
!e2e/package.json
!runner/package.json
!runner/tsconfig.json
!runner/src/
!runner/src/**
